  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">전에 liveworksheets로 학습지 만드는 법을 알려주셔서 요즘 잘 활용하고 있어요. 언제나 좋은 자료들 공유해주시는 선생님들께 정말 감사드립니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">제가 만든 걸 완성본 그대로 공유해드리기엔 부족한 점이 너무 많아, 혹시 수정해서 쓰시면 그래도 좀 건질게 있지 않을까~하여 워크시트 재료?들을 모두 올려봅니당 ^^</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>1. 제가 학생들에게 내 준 과제↓</b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">#8.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오늘 과제는<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">liveworksheet</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로 제출합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\"><a href=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/el611740co\">https://www.liveworksheets.com/el611740co<span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\"></span><br></a></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span ></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&#8226;<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">Enter your full name:<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학번<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">_ 30500)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span ></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&#8226;<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">Level/group:<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학급<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">_ 3-5)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span ></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&#8226;<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">School subject:<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전선</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span ></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&#8226;<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">key code:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-jsonlen=\"8843\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"></div><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span ></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&#8226;<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제출 시 입력 사항이 틀리면 미제출로 처리될 수 있으니 두 번씩 확인하세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>2. 편집에 도움되시라고 ①ppt 파일, ②라이브워크시트의&nbsp;편집 화면 캡쳐한 거 첨부할께요.</b></p></div><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">온라인으로 한랭 전선과 온난 전선을 설명하는게 너무 무시무시한 용어들만 던져주는 기분이 들어서요.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">최대한 애들이 관심가질 수 있게, 아~ 해볼만 하다~ 라는 기분이 들었으면 좋겠다는 생각으로 만들어서&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">좀 유치한 면이 많아요. 전선 전면과 후면도<span>&nbsp;</span>좀 표현하고 싶었는데, 요건 아직 부족한 것 같아요.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D609%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20200521162536&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile244.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99FBAF4A5EC62C10037175')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 16차시 과제(live).show</a></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoratio